{"id":143414063,"slug":"dont-just-say-hi-on-the-hacker-slackand","title":"\"Don't Just Say Hi\" On The Hacker Slack..and other Change Healthcare Stories","subtitle":"I follow the story-- so you don't have to.","post_date":"2024-04-09T13:14:21.749Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/dont-just-say-hi-on-the-hacker-slackand","wordcount":428,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:53:36.069Z","body_sha256":"54fa5bed49557005d9fcc062929b2c1c32441761b031d9ba48527cd5372bf5b7","text_words":427,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>The Frontier Psychiatrists videos on TikTok are now page one google search results!  (Search: “united cyberattack”) at least from my phone:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pBIY!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c768f19-2e3a-4663-b8a9-cf0200302786_1290x1459.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pBIY!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c768f19-2e3a-4663-b8a9-cf0200302786_1290x1459.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pBIY!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c768f19-2e3a-4663-b8a9-cf0200302786_1290x1459.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pBIY!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c768f19-2e3a-4663-b8a9-cf0200302786_1290x1459.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pBIY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post